  "description": "Microsoft Entra ID hosted-web (OpenID Connect) sign-in provider for the Orleans.Lattice Explorer web console. Wires ASP.NET Core OIDC (auth-code + PKCE) and a cookie session via Microsoft.Identity.Web, then acquires and silently refreshes a bearer token for an auth-enabled State API on behalf of the signed-in browser user - the flow the interactive desktop provider (Orleans.Lattice.Explorer.Entra) cannot serve because a remote Blazor Server circuit has no local browser. Keeps the Microsoft.Identity.Web dependency out of the core explorer.",
